        "14 CFR § 107.27 Alcohol or drugs. (2025 edition)"
      ],
      "text": "A person manipulating the flight controls of a small unmanned aircraft system or acting as a remote pilot in command or visual observer must comply with the provisions of §§ 91.17 and 91.19 of this chapter.",
